<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Hold (spell)</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast hold &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>The hold spell magically keeps a humanoid or animal target from fighting for 
five rounds, and from fleeing in that time. It has no effect on other creatures. 
The spell is very difficult to use and may therefore fail quite often, and 
casting it starts a fight with the target whether it works or not.
</p><p>For the hold command, holding something in your hand, see <a cmd='#'>Help Hold</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hold Monster</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hold Animal</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hold Undead</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Casting</a>
</pre>




</div>